個當然先喝湯，真的好濃郁，滿好喝，但沒有辣感覺，只好旁邊剛好有辣油加看看，真的超不錯喝。🤤\n而且帥哥員工也會過來要不要加麵，老公剛好要加，擔心他一定吃不下，我只好幫忙夾麵吃。😅那邊也有飲料，滿方便。😊\n原來聽老公說這是他同事推薦這地方，說好吃。才會帶我來這吃晚餐，下次還要帶女兒跟她的男友一起來這吃看看。😎真的不錯推薦。👍🏻 👍🏻",null,[0,162]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12814335757316007800/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDVGxreVRqTlNWRWw1WlVoQ1ZGZFlRbFZPUjNoUFRUTlplbGxzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12814335757316007800/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDVGxreVRqTlNWRWw1WlVoQ1ZGZFlRbFZPUjNoUFRUTlplbGxzUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12814335757316007800/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDVGxreVRqTlNWRWw1WlVoQ1ZGZFlRbFZPUjNoUFRUTlplbGxzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12814335757316007800/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDVGxreVRqTlNWRWw1WlVoQ1ZGZFlRbFZPUjNoUFRUTlplbGxzUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12814335757316007800/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDVGxreVRqTlNWRWw1WlVoQ1ZGZFlRbFZPUjNoUFRUTlplbGxzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12814335757316007800/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDVGxreVRqTlNWRWw1WlVoQ1ZGZFlRbFZPUjNoUFRUTlplbGxzUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,12295,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CTlkyTjNSVEl5ZUhCVFdYQlVOR3hPTTNZellsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x10fe637927d65138!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnBNY2N3RTIyeHBTWXBUNGxOM3YzYlE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CTlkyTjNSVEl5ZUhCVFdYQlVOR3hPTTNZellsRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CTlkyTjNSVEl5ZUhCVFdYQlVOR3hPTTNZellsRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CTlkyTjNSVEl5ZUhCVFdYQlVOR3hPTTNZellsRRILMGRUNEhlbzI1V00aPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09uQk5ZMk4zUlRJeWVIQlRXWEJVTkd4T0